---
description: Benchmark Structure and Standards
globs: ["**/*.pp"]
alwaysApply: true
---

When creating benchmarks:

1. Naming Convention:
- Use format: benchmark "{service}_detections"
- Use lowercase with underscores
- Must end with "_detections"

2. Structure Template:
```hcl
benchmark "service_detections" {
  title       = "Service Name Detections"
  description = "One-line description of the benchmark scope"
  type        = "detection"
  children    = [
    detection.detection_name_1,
    detection.detection_name_2
  ]
  tags = merge(local.service_common_tags, {
    type = "Benchmark"
  })
}
```

3. Organization:
- List all related detections in children block
- Keep descriptions concise and focused on scope
- Always include type = "detection" 
